{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"_CleverOnion_","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"Windrises 有一个键盘，键盘上的 $26$ 键水平排列在一条线上。\n\n键盘的排列（从左到右）用字符串 $S$ 表示，$S$ 是 `ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ` 的随机排列。\n\nWindrises 将使用此键盘按 `ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ` 顺序打字，用右手食指准确按下每个字母一次。要按下一个字符，Windrises 需要将手指移到与该字符对应的按键处并按下该键。\n\n起初，Windrises 的手指位于字母 \"A \"对应的按键处。请找出从按下`A`键到按下`Z`键（按照`ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ`的顺序按完一遍所有的字母）手指可能移动的最小总距离。","source":"AtCoder","title":"Windrises 的1D键盘","type":0,"output":"输出从按下A键到按下Z键之间手指可能移动的最小总距离。","ioScore":100,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":2000,"difficulty":0,"input":"输入键盘的排列 $S$。","examples":"<input>ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ</input><output>25</output><input>MGJYIZDKSBHPVENFLQURTCWOAX</input><output>223</output>","hint":"","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0016","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Java","Python3"],"samples":[{"output":"Q00161.out","input":"Q00161.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00162.out","input":"Q00162.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00163.out","input":"Q00163.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00164.out","input":"Q00164.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00165.out","input":"Q00165.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00166.out","input":"Q00166.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00167.out","input":"Q00167.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00168.out","input":"Q00168.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00169.out","input":"Q00169.in","score":10},{"output":"Q001610.out","input":"Q001610.in","score":10}],"tags":["循环","数组"],"codeTemplates":[],"judgeMode":"default"}